{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4277","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ10_bikeCarscratch","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I inform the neighbor."},"2":{"Display":"I keep quiet about the incident."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_bikeCarscratch","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ10_bikeCarscratch","QuestionID":"QID4277","QuestionText":"While locking up my bike, it falls against a car. In the darkness, I do not detect any scratches on the car. The next day, I hear my well-known neighbor complaining about a fresh scratch on his new car. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"While locking up my bike, it falls against a car. In the darkness, I do not detect any scratches on the car. The next day, I hear my well-known neighbor complaining about a fresh scratch on his new car. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4278","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ11_soccerVSfriend","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I meet up with my friend."},"2":{"Display":"I watch the soccer game."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_soccerVSfriend","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ11_soccerVSfriend","QuestionID":"QID4278","QuestionText":"It is the soccer world cup and the final match is on TV. I am a big soccer fan and very excited about the game. All of a sudden, a friend of mine who is not feeling well gives me a call and wants to meet up with me right now. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"It is the soccer world cup and the final match is on TV. I am a big soccer fan and very excited about the game. All of a sudden, a friend of mine who is not feeling well gives me a call and wants to meet up with me right now. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4279","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ12_examVSparty","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I keep my promise."},"2":{"Display":"I prepare for the exam."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_partyVSexam","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ12_examVSparty","QuestionID":"QID4279","QuestionText":"I have promised my partner to go to the company party with them. They have already signed both of us up. Now I realize that I would urgently need the time to prepare for an important exam. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I have promised my partner to go to the company party with them. They have already signed both of us up. Now I realize that I would urgently need the time to prepare for an important exam. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4280","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ13_mothersMoney","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I return the money to my mother."},"2":{"Display":"I keep the money."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_mothersMoney","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ13_mothersMoney","QuestionID":"QID4280","QuestionText":"My mother gives me \u00a320 to buy pet food. At the pet store, I see that the pet food is on special offer and only costs \u00a310. Since I have many expenses this month, I could use the remaining \u00a310 very well for myself. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"My mother gives me \u00a320 to buy pet food. At the pet store, I see that the pet food is on special offer and only costs \u00a310. Since I have many expenses this month, I could use the remaining \u00a310 very well for myself. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4281","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ14_lastTicket","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I give the ticket to him."},"2":{"Display":"I keep the ticket for myself."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_lastTicket","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ14_lastTicket","QuestionID":"QID4281","QuestionText":"A good band is going to give a concert in town. At the ticket agency, I get the very last ticket. When a classmate and friend standing behind me in line realizes this, he is appalled and bursts into tears. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"A good band is going to give a concert in town. At the ticket agency, I get the very last ticket. When a classmate and friend standing behind me in line realizes this, he is appalled and bursts into tears. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4282","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ15_grandfatherVSconcert","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I help my grandfather."},"2":{"Display":"I go to the concert."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_grandfatherVSco","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ15_grandfatherVSconcert","QuestionID":"QID4282","QuestionText":"I have promised my grandfather to help him complete urgent forms this evening. All of a sudden, I get a phone call from the newspaper. I have won tickets for my favorite band\u2019s sold out concert tonight. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I have promised my grandfather to help him complete urgent forms this evening. All of a sudden, I get a phone call from the newspaper. I have won tickets for my favorite band\u2019s sold out concert tonight. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4283","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ16_holidayVShospital","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I cancel the holiday."},"2":{"Display":"I take the\u00a0flight anyway."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_holidayVShospit","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ16_holidayVShospital","QuestionID":"QID4283","QuestionText":"I am at the airport, ready to leave on a long-planned holiday. While I am standing at the check-in counter, my mother gives me a call. She tells me that my father had a little accident and was admitted to the hospital. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I am at the airport, ready to leave on a long-planned holiday. While I am standing at the check-in counter, my mother gives me a call. She tells me that my father had a little accident and was admitted to the hospital. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_2t4UF1nJSAUJ3My","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4284","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ17_parcelGVSgym","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I wait for the parcel service."},"2":{"Display":"I go to the gym course."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_parcelVSgym","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ17_parcelGVSgym","QuestionID":"QID4284","QuestionText":"I have promised a neighbor and friend to receive an urgent parcel for her today. Now, it is 5 pm and the parcel service has not been here yet. My gym course will start soon and I would really like to participate. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I have promised a neighbor and friend to receive an urgent parcel for her today. Now, it is 5 pm and the parcel service has not been here yet. My gym course will start soon and I would really like to participate. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
